d085e510c1be2b33d","layer":"pei","quote":"时太子在邺，鄢陵侯未到。士民颇苦劳役，又有疾疠，于是军中骚动。群僚恐天下有变，欲不发丧。逵建议为不可秘；乃发哀，令内外皆入临；临讫，各安叙不得动","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-431424450984aebb9adc","start":10,"end":82},{"id":"liusima-q-d177a3fd8037444d8b42","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-ceeabba7326adc815c60","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩洛阳，逵典丧事","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":247,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10},{"id":"lizang-q-54b6a464847594168c95","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-b53c36252af997a8432a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，褚号泣呕血","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":134,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":153,"end":162},{"id":"lizang-q-5c248549841055834243","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-6af15624c45c822aafe4","layer":"pei","quote":"会太祖崩，霸所部及青州兵，以为天下将乱，皆鸣鼓擅去","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-09e55711afecdcb903dc","start":50,"end":75},{"id":"lizang-q2-832bb3bbfb1fb68b9819","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-6af15624c45c822aafe4","layer":"pei","quote":"文帝即位，以曹休都督青、徐。霸谓休曰：‘国家未肯听霸耳！若假霸步骑万人，必能横行江表。’休言之于帝，帝疑霸军前擅去，今意壮乃尔；遂东巡，因霸来朝，而夺其兵。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-09e55711afecdcb903dc","start":76,"end":154},{"id":"rencheng-q-f1c437305679c95be1cc","section":"chapter-019","block":"b-fc65ddc82bffa504d4f1","layer":"original","quote":"太祖至洛阳，得疾，驿召彰。未至，太祖崩。","section_title":"任城陈萧王传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0043.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"wudi-e-o200a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3971bfd8e9cb605255dc","layer":"original","quote":"庚子〖2〗，王崩于洛阳〖3〗。年六十六。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":445,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"wudi-q-b-14b02b05b047b9111bbf","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-14b02b05b047b9111bbf","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十五年：建安二十五年（公元 220）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":448,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-be911b1e318b4c76c0fa","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"wudi-q-o199","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-de411566fbf9cdd8658d","layer":"original","quote":"二十五年春正月〖1〗，至洛阳。权击斩羽，传其首。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o039a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-b9c30b0efbc9031d81d3","layer":"original","quote":"二十五年春正月〖1〗，曹公薨；","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
